window.EXAM_DATA = {"id":"t4","title":"Topic 4 · completo","title_es":"Topic 4 · todas las preguntas (incluye secuenciales y Case Studies del Topic)","cases":{"CS1":{"title":"Case Study: Northwind Traders","en":"<h4>Background</h4>\n<p>Northwind Traders is an independent, family-owned business. The company distributes natural pet products in the Northwest region of the country/region. Products are purchased directly from manufacturers and distributed by using its own fleet of trucks.</p>\n<p>When the company started, deliveries were within a three-hour radius of the warehouse. Due to regional growth, current deliveries require drivers to stay overnight on some routes. The company plans to open a second warehouse to expand the region and eliminate overnights for route drivers. The company also plans to hire a second group of employees to run operations in this new location. The finance and accounting teams will remain in the original location.</p>\n<p>The company uses a third-party system for financials and order management. The finance department stated that the company's fiscal year begins on July 1 and ends on June 30. The mm/dd/yyyy date format is used.</p>\n<p>As part of the expansion, the owner plans to upgrade to an ERP system and use Business Central to fulfill the company requirements and manage growth.</p>\n<h4>Current environment</h4>\n<p><b>Orders</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Orders are emailed to customer service and manually keyed into the inventory system.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Pricing and discounts</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customer pricing is determined by the customer market type. Customer market types are Retail, Veterinarian, and Breeder. Each customer is associated with only one market type.</li>\n<li>Vendors offer monthly promotions to customers by item, brand, or item category.</li>\n<li>Invoices should show each customer's base price, the discount amount, and the net price.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Accounts payable</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The company wants to expand vendor payment options in the new system.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Requirements</h4>\n<p><b>Customers</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The sales team must be able to: quickly set up new customers with the proper settings based on customer type; identify customers by market type. Customer posting groups will be used to identify which market the customer belongs to.</li>\n<li>Base price is determined by the customer market type.</li>\n<li>The sales department should receive a warning when entering the order if a customer is over their credit limit.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Sales</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customer discounts are offered for specific time frames by item, brand, or product category. Discounts should be added to sales lines automatically.</li>\n<li>Discounts must post to a unique general ledger (G/L) account.</li>\n<li>The business needs to be able to track revenue by location, market, and product category dimensions. Locations 100 and 200 will be set as default dimensions on the two warehouse locations. Food, treats, toys, and supplies are the required product categories, which will be set as default dimensions on the item cards. Each customer card will have a default market dimension.</li>\n<li>The sales manager wants to delete canceled orders and automatically archive them.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Warehouse</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Orders will be fulfilled from two possible warehouse locations.</li>\n<li>Product will be transferred between locations by using transfer orders.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Sales invoices</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Invoices will be posted after delivery.</li>\n<li>Invoices will be emailed to the customer.</li>\n<li>The sales department must be able to quickly correct posted invoices for: posted invoices that have not been paid; posted invoices that have been paid; posted invoices created from sales orders; posted invoices not created from sales orders.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Accounting</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The finance department requires that the company has 12 monthly accounting periods per fiscal year.</li>\n<li>Finance department users must be able to reconcile the accounts receivable (AR) subledger to the G/L account at month end.</li>\n<li>AR department users need the ability to settle and close invoices when customers take payment discounts after the payment discount date has passed. AR users should be allowed to accept or reject the payment tolerance.</li>\n<li>Accounts payable (AP) department users must be able to pay vendors by electronic funds transfer (EFT) and use a payment journal batch named EFT to process payments.</li>\n<li>When viewing G/L entries, the finance and accounting teams must be able to see debits and credits instead of a positive or negative amount.</li>\n<li>The company needs to be able to track expenses by department and location. The departments are sales, operations, and administration.</li>\n<li>AR must be able to correct cash application entries.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Issues</h4>\n<p><b>Payment application</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customers may have several stores that are responsible for their own orders and payments.</li>\n<li>Occasionally, AR clerks mistakenly apply payments to the incorrect customer invoice.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Invoicing</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>When items are delivered, customers refuse the items for reasons such as damaged or wrong item.</li>\n<li>After the invoices are posted, they must be corrected, which is time-consuming.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Warehouse</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The sales department and warehouse managers must have visibility into products that are in the process of being transferred between locations.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Accounts</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customer accounts are difficult to view by market type.</li>\n<li>The finance team does not have the ability to report revenue by customer type.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Accounting</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>AR users often find variances between the AR subledger and G/L account.</li>\n<li>Customers often take the payment discount after the payment discount date has passed, leaving open invoices for small amounts.</li>\n<li>The AP department is unable to pay vendors by EFT in the current system.</li>\n<li>Finance and accounting team members have trouble validating postings when they use only the amounts field on G/L entries.</li>\n<li>The finance department is unable to run financial reports by market. All revenue postings must reference a market.</li>\n</ul>","es":"<h4>Contexto</h4>\n<p>Northwind Traders es una empresa familiar independiente que distribuye productos naturales para mascotas en la región noroeste del país. Compra directamente a los fabricantes y reparte con su propia flota de camiones.</p>\n<p>Al principio, las entregas estaban a menos de tres horas del almacén. Con el crecimiento, algunas rutas obligan a los conductores a pasar la noche fuera. La empresa va a abrir un segundo almacén para ampliar la región y evitar esas noches, y contratará otro equipo para operar en la nueva ubicación. Finanzas y contabilidad seguirán en la ubicación original.</p>\n<p>Hoy usa un sistema de terceros para finanzas y gestión de pedidos. Su ejercicio (fiscal year) empieza el 1 de julio y termina el 30 de junio. Se usa el formato de fecha mm/dd/yyyy.</p>\n<p>Con la expansión, el propietario quiere pasar a un ERP y usar Business Central.</p>\n<h4>Entorno actual</h4>\n<p><b>Pedidos</b></p><ul><li>Los pedidos llegan por email a atención al cliente y se teclean a mano en el sistema de inventario.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Precios y descuentos</b></p><ul><li>El precio depende del tipo de mercado del cliente: Retail, Veterinarian y Breeder. Cada cliente pertenece a un solo mercado.</li><li>Los proveedores ofrecen promociones mensuales por producto, marca o categoría.</li><li>Las facturas deben mostrar el precio base, el importe del descuento y el precio neto.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Cuentas a pagar</b></p><ul><li>La empresa quiere ampliar las formas de pago a proveedores en el nuevo sistema.</li></ul>\n<h4>Requisitos</h4>\n<p><b>Clientes</b></p><ul><li>El equipo de ventas debe poder dar de alta clientes rápidamente con la configuración correcta según su tipo e identificar a los clientes por mercado. Se usarán los customer posting groups para identificar el mercado de cada cliente.</li><li>El precio base depende del mercado del cliente.</li><li>Ventas debe recibir un aviso al introducir el pedido si el cliente supera su límite de crédito.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Ventas</b></p><ul><li>Los descuentos se ofrecen durante periodos concretos por producto, marca o categoría y deben añadirse automáticamente a las líneas de venta.</li><li>Los descuentos deben registrarse en una cuenta contable (G/L) propia.</li><li>Hay que analizar los ingresos por las dimensiones ubicación, mercado y categoría de producto. Las ubicaciones 100 y 200 serán default dimensions de los dos almacenes; las categorías Food, Treats, Toys y Supplies serán default dimensions en las fichas de producto; cada cliente tendrá una dimensión de mercado por defecto.</li><li>El jefe de ventas quiere borrar los pedidos cancelados y archivarlos automáticamente.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Almacén</b></p><ul><li>Los pedidos se servirán desde dos almacenes posibles.</li><li>Los productos se moverán entre almacenes con transfer orders.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Facturas de venta</b></p><ul><li>Las facturas se registrarán después de la entrega.</li><li>Se enviarán al cliente por email.</li><li>Ventas debe poder corregir rápidamente facturas registradas: no pagadas, pagadas, creadas desde pedidos de venta y no creadas desde pedidos.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Contabilidad</b></p><ul><li>Finanzas necesita 12 periodos contables mensuales por ejercicio.</li><li>Finanzas debe poder conciliar a fin de mes el subledger de clientes (AR) con la cuenta contable.</li><li>AR debe poder liquidar y cerrar facturas cuando el cliente se toma el descuento por pronto pago después de la fecha de descuento, pudiendo aceptar o rechazar la tolerancia.</li><li>Cuentas a pagar (AP) debe poder pagar por transferencia electrónica (EFT) usando una sección del diario de pagos llamada EFT.</li><li>Al ver los movimientos contables, finanzas quiere ver debe y haber en lugar de importes positivos o negativos.</li><li>Hay que analizar los gastos por departamento (ventas, operaciones, administración) y ubicación.</li><li>AR debe poder corregir aplicaciones de cobros.</li></ul>\n<h4>Problemas</h4>\n<p><b>Aplicación de pagos</b></p><ul><li>Algunos clientes tienen varias tiendas responsables de sus propios pedidos y pagos.</li><li>A veces AR aplica los pagos a la factura equivocada.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Facturación</b></p><ul><li>Al entregar, los clientes rechazan productos (dañados, equivocados…).</li><li>Después de registrar las facturas hay que corregirlas, lo que lleva mucho tiempo.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Almacén</b></p><ul><li>Ventas y los responsables de almacén deben ver los productos que se están transfiriendo entre almacenes.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Cuentas</b></p><ul><li>Es difícil ver las cuentas de clientes por mercado.</li><li>Finanzas no puede informar de los ingresos por tipo de cliente.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Contabilidad</b></p><ul><li>AR encuentra a menudo diferencias entre el subledger de clientes y la cuenta contable.</li><li>Los clientes se toman el descuento después de la fecha, dejando facturas abiertas por importes pequeños.</li><li>AP no puede pagar por EFT con el sistema actual.</li><li>Finanzas tiene problemas para validar registros usando solo el campo Amount de los G/L entries.</li><li>Finanzas no puede sacar informes por mercado. Todos los registros de ingresos deben llevar un mercado.</li></ul>"}},"questions":[{"id":"t4q1","type":"drag","en":"A company is replacing their current solution with Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>During the user acceptance testing, you identify several gaps in the solution.<br><br>You must add new functionality to the accounts receivable role center to allow order entry clerks to view the number of sales orders that they have created for the month to date. Clerks must be able to move the new role center element to another position on their interface.<br><br>Accounts receivable clerks each have a specific order in which they enter sales order data. You must optimize the order entry process for these users.<br><br>You need to configure the system.<br><br>Which features should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate features to the correct requirements. Each feature may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Hay que añadir al Role Center de cuentas a cobrar un elemento que muestre a los administrativos el número de pedidos de venta creados en el mes, y que puedan moverlo. Además, cada administrativo introduce los pedidos en un orden concreto y hay que optimizar esa entrada.<br><br>¿Qué funcionalidad corresponde a cada requisito? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 4 · Q1","valuesTitle":"Features","targetHeader":["Requirement","Feature"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Designer","es":"Designer"},{"id":"V2","en":"My Settings","es":"My Settings"},{"id":"V3","en":"Personalization","es":"Personalization"},{"id":"V4","en":"Advanced Settings","es":"Advanced Settings"}],"targets":[{"en":"Display the number of sales orders created for the month to date.","es":"Mostrar el número de pedidos de venta creados en lo que va de mes."},{"en":"Optimize the order entry screen for users.","es":"Optimizar la pantalla de entrada de pedidos para los usuarios."}]},{"id":"t4q2","type":"drag","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to create filters for ledger entries.<br><br>Which features should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate features to the correct requirements. Each feature may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Debes crear filtros para movimientos (ledger entries).<br><br>¿Qué funcionalidad corresponde a cada requisito? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 4 · Q2","valuesTitle":"Features","targetHeader":["Requirement","Feature"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Views","es":"Views"},{"id":"V2","en":"Filter list by","es":"Filter list by"},{"id":"V3","en":"Filter total by","es":"Filter total by"}],"targets":[{"en":"Create a filter for a list and save the filter for later use.","es":"Crear un filtro para una lista y guardarlo para usarlo después."},{"en":"Add filters on specific fields to reduce the number of displayed records.","es":"Filtrar por campos concretos para reducir los registros mostrados."},{"en":"Modify dimensions that influence calculations.","es":"Modificar las dimensiones que influyen en los cálculos."}]},{"id":"t4q3","type":"mr","en":"A company is using Dynamics 365 Business Central. You manually import bank transactions daily.<br><br>You need to streamline operations and implement automated processes that connect banks with Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>Which two tools can you use? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central e importa a mano cada día las transacciones bancarias.<br><br>Debes automatizar el proceso conectando los bancos con Business Central. ¿Qué dos herramientas puedes usar?","src":"Topic 4 · Q3","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Extensions","es":"Extensions"},{"id":"B","en":"Export Electronic Payments","es":"Export Electronic Payments"},{"id":"C","en":"Document Sending Profiles","es":"Document Sending Profiles"},{"id":"D","en":"Document Exchange Service","es":"Document Exchange Service"},{"id":"E","en":"AppSource","es":"AppSource"}],"select":2},{"id":"t4q4","type":"drag","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to configure the system for new customers.<br><br>Which features should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate features to the correct requirements. Each feature may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Debes configurar el sistema para los clientes nuevos.<br><br>¿Qué funcionalidad corresponde a cada requisito? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 4 · Q4","valuesTitle":"Features","targetHeader":["Requirement","Feature"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Document Layouts","es":"Document Layouts"},{"id":"V2","en":"Document Sending Profile","es":"Document Sending Profile"},{"id":"V3","en":"Word Template","es":"Word Template"}],"targets":[{"en":"Specify the layouts that will be used for different types of documents that you create for customers.","es":"Indicar los layouts que se usan para cada tipo de documento del cliente."},{"en":"Configure the preferred document sharing method for customers.","es":"Configurar el método preferido de envío de documentos al cliente."}]},{"id":"t4q6","type":"mr","en":"You need to configure Dynamics 365 Business Central to allow for receipt of quantities of items greater than the quantity ordered.<br><br>What are two possible ways to achieve the goal? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Debes permitir que se reciban cantidades mayores que las pedidas.<br><br>¿Cuáles son dos formas posibles de conseguirlo? Cada respuesta correcta es una solución completa.","src":"Topic 4 · Q6","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Configure a maximum order quantity for the item","es":"Configurar una cantidad máxima de pedido en el producto"},{"id":"B","en":"Configure a maximum inventory level for the item","es":"Configurar un nivel máximo de inventario en el producto"},{"id":"C","en":"Set up and select an over-receipt code in the item record","es":"Crear un over-receipt code y asignarlo en el producto"},{"id":"D","en":"Set up and select an over-receipt code in the vendor record","es":"Crear un over-receipt code y asignarlo en el proveedor"}],"select":2},{"id":"t4q7","type":"drag","en":"You have multiple, unpaid posted purchase invoices to reverse. Some invoices require complete reversal while others need partial reversal.<br><br>You need to process credit memos from the posted purchase invoices page.<br><br>Which actions should you perform? To answer, drag the appropriate action buttons to the correct requirements. Each action button may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Debes anular varias facturas de compra registradas y no pagadas, unas totalmente y otras en parte, desde Posted Purchase Invoices.<br><br>¿Qué acción corresponde a cada requisito? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 4 · Q7","valuesTitle":"Action buttons","targetHeader":["Requirement","Action button"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Cancel","es":"Cancel"},{"id":"V2","en":"Correct","es":"Correct"},{"id":"V3","en":"Create Corrective Credit Memo","es":"Create Corrective Credit Memo"}],"targets":[{"en":"Automatically create and post a corrective purchase credit memo to void the initial posted purchase invoice.","es":"Crear y registrar automáticamente un abono que anule la factura original."},{"en":"Enable users to manually post credit memos.","es":"Permitir que el usuario registre el abono manualmente."},{"en":"Create a new purchase invoice to replace a canceled invoice.","es":"Crear una factura nueva que sustituya a la anulada."}]},{"id":"t4q9","type":"mr","en":"You have a Microsoft Excel file that includes journal entry data that must be imported into Dynamics 365 Business Central. This file was previously imported into a General Journal batch.<br><br>You receive an updated version of the file that includes corrections, deletions, and new journal entries.<br><br>Which two actions can you perform by using the Edit in Excel feature? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Tienes un Excel con datos de asientos que ya se importó en una sección del General Journal. Recibes una versión actualizada con correcciones, borrados y asientos nuevos.<br><br>¿Qué dos acciones puedes hacer con <b>Edit in Excel</b>?","src":"Topic 4 · Q9","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Modify an existing line in a General Journal batch","es":"Modificar una línea existente de la sección."},{"id":"B","en":"Insert a new line in a General Journal batch","es":"Insertar una línea nueva en la sección."},{"id":"C","en":"Post one or more lines in a General Journal batch","es":"Registrar una o varias líneas de la sección."},{"id":"D","en":"Request Approval for one or more lines in a General Journal batch","es":"Pedir aprobación de una o varias líneas."},{"id":"E","en":"Delete an existing line from a General Journal batch","es":"Eliminar una línea existente de la sección."}],"select":2},{"id":"t4q10","type":"mr","en":"A user reports that they cannot create or view sales quotes in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to help the user create and view sales quotes.<br><br>From which three cards can the user perform the required activities? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Un usuario no consigue crear ni ver sales quotes (ofertas de venta).<br><br>¿Desde qué tres fichas puede hacerlo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q10","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Service Item","es":"Service Item"},{"id":"B","en":"Opportunity","es":"Opportunity (oportunidad)"},{"id":"C","en":"Job","es":"Job (proyecto)"},{"id":"D","en":"Resource","es":"Resource (recurso)"},{"id":"E","en":"Customer","es":"Customer (cliente)"},{"id":"F","en":"Contact","es":"Contact (contacto)"}],"select":3},{"id":"t4q14","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a company. The company provides subscription services to their customers. The subscription invoices are almost identical each month.<br><br>The company wants to set up recurring sales lines for subscription invoices.<br><br>You need to create systems for creating subscription invoices.<br><br>Solution: Create a blanket order. Add the necessary lines to the blanket order. Create the monthly sales order. Then, create the invoice.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Implantas Business Central para una empresa que vende suscripciones. Las facturas de suscripción son casi iguales cada mes y la empresa quiere usar líneas de venta recurrentes.<br><br>Debes crear el sistema para generar las facturas de suscripción.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> crear un pedido abierto (blanket order), añadir las líneas, crear el pedido de venta mensual y después la factura.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q14","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q15","type":"yn","en":"<b>Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.</b><br><br>You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a company. The company provides subscription services to their customers. The subscription invoices are almost identical each month.<br><br>The company wants to set up recurring sales lines for subscription invoices.<br><br>You need to create systems for creating subscription invoices.<br><br>Solution: Create a new recurring sales line. Open the relevant customers and attach the Recurring Sales Lines code to the customer. Then, run the Create Recurring Sales Invoices batch to create the invoices.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<b>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo. Algunas series tienen más de una solución correcta y otras ninguna.</b><br><br>Una empresa presta servicios de suscripción y sus facturas son casi idénticas cada mes. Quiere configurar líneas de venta periódicas (recurring sales lines) para estas facturas.<br><br>Solución: crear un código de recurring sales lines, asignarlo a los clientes correspondientes y ejecutar el proceso Create Recurring Sales Invoices.<br><br>¿La solución cumple el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q15","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q16","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a company. The company provides subscription services to their customers. The subscription invoices are almost identical each month.<br><br>The company wants to set up recurring sales lines for subscription invoices.<br><br>You need to create systems for creating subscription invoices.<br><br>Solution: Create a sales quote for each customer. Add the sales lines to the quote. Then, use the Copy Document feature to create a new invoice.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Implantas Business Central para una empresa que vende suscripciones. Las facturas de suscripción son casi iguales cada mes y la empresa quiere usar líneas de venta recurrentes.<br><br>Debes crear el sistema para generar las facturas de suscripción.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> crear una oferta de venta por cliente con las líneas y usar <b>Copy Document</b> para crear cada factura.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q16","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q17","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a company. The company provides subscription services to their customers. The subscription invoices are almost identical each month.<br><br>The company wants to set up recurring sales lines for subscription invoices.<br><br>You need to create systems for creating subscription invoices.<br><br>Solution: Create a new recurring sales line code. Then, run the Create Recurring Invoices batch to create the invoice.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Implantas Business Central para una empresa que vende suscripciones. Las facturas de suscripción son casi iguales cada mes y la empresa quiere usar líneas de venta recurrentes.<br><br>Debes crear el sistema para generar las facturas de suscripción.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> crear un código de líneas de venta recurrentes y ejecutar el proceso <b>Create Recurring Sales Invoices</b>.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q17","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q18","type":"mc","en":"Two cash receipts were applied to a posted sales transaction. The first receipt was applied in error.<br><br>You need to remove the first cash receipt from the posted sales transaction.<br><br>Which set of steps should you perform?","es":"Se aplicaron dos cobros a una venta registrada y el primero se aplicó por error.<br><br>Debes quitar el primer cobro de la venta registrada. ¿Qué pasos debes seguir?","src":"Topic 4 · Q18","options":[{"id":"A","en":"1. Navigate to Unapply Entries from the relevant customer ledger entry. 2. Unapply the second payment. 3. Unapply the first payment. 4. Apply the second payment to the customer ledger entry.","es":"1. Abrir Unapply Entries desde el movimiento de cliente. 2. Desliquidar el segundo pago. 3. Desliquidar el primero. 4. Volver a liquidar el segundo pago con el movimiento."},{"id":"B","en":"1. Navigate to Reverse Transaction from the relevant detailed customer ledger entry. 2. Reverse the second payment. 3. Reverse the first payment. 4. Apply the second payment to the customer ledger entry.","es":"1. Abrir Reverse Transaction desde el movimiento detallado de cliente. 2. Revertir el segundo pago. 3. Revertir el primero. 4. Liquidar el segundo pago."},{"id":"C","en":"1. Navigate to Reverse Transaction from the relevant customer ledger entry. 2. Reverse the second payment. 3. Reverse the first payment. 4. Apply the second payment to the customer ledger entry.","es":"1. Abrir Reverse Transaction desde el movimiento de cliente. 2. Revertir el segundo pago. 3. Revertir el primero. 4. Liquidar el segundo pago."},{"id":"D","en":"1. Post a reversing Cash Receipt and select the customer and relevant payment entry. 2. Navigate to Unapply Entries from the relevant customer ledger entry. 3. Unapply the payment.","es":"1. Registrar un cobro inverso seleccionando el cliente y el pago. 2. Abrir Unapply Entries desde el movimiento de cliente. 3. Desliquidar el pago."}]},{"id":"t4q19","type":"mc","en":"A company uses the average costing method and inventory periods. Automatic Cost Posting is not enabled.<br><br>You close the inventory period for July 2020. You set the value of the Allow Posting From field in General Ledger Setup to August 1, 2020.<br><br>You receive and post a purchase invoice for freight charges on August 8, 2020 against a purchase invoice that was posted on July 15, 2020. You run the Adjust cost – Item entries batch job for August.<br><br>You need to identify the adjustment entry related to July after running the batch job.<br><br>Which date is automatically selected for the value entry by batch job?","es":"Una empresa usa el método de coste Average y periodos de inventario. <b>Automatic Cost Posting</b> no está activado.<br><br>Cierras el periodo de inventario de julio de 2020 y pones <b>Allow Posting From</b> = 1 de agosto de 2020 en General Ledger Setup.<br><br>El 8 de agosto de 2020 registras una factura de transporte contra una factura de compra registrada el 15 de julio de 2020. Ejecutas <b>Adjust Cost – Item Entries</b> para agosto.<br><br>¿Qué fecha asigna el proceso al movimiento de valor del ajuste relacionado con julio?","src":"Topic 4 · Q19","options":[{"id":"A","en":"July 15, 2020","es":"15 de julio de 2020"},{"id":"B","en":"August 8, 2020","es":"8 de agosto de 2020"},{"id":"C","en":"August 1, 2020","es":"1 de agosto de 2020"},{"id":"D","en":"July 1, 2020","es":"1 de julio de 2020"}]},{"id":"t4q20","type":"drag","en":"You set up a new company in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to demonstrate Page Inspection functionality.<br><br>Which features should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate page inspection features to the correct display requirements. Each page inspection feature may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Has configurado una company nueva y debes mostrar Page Inspection.<br><br>¿Qué funcionalidad corresponde a cada requisito? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 4 · Q20","valuesTitle":"Page inspection features","targetHeader":["Display requirement","Page inspection feature"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"View Table link","es":"View Table link"},{"id":"V2","en":"Table Fields tab","es":"Table Fields tab"},{"id":"V3","en":"Extensions tab","es":"Extensions tab"},{"id":"V4","en":"Page field","es":"Page field"}],"targets":[{"en":"All data in all fields in a record.","es":"Todos los datos de todos los campos de un registro."},{"en":"All active apps altering a page.","es":"Todas las apps activas que modifican la página."},{"en":"The tables that provide data for a page.","es":"Las tablas que aportan datos a la página."}]},{"id":"t4q23","type":"mr","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a company.<br><br>The company needs to receive more items than they ordered from a vendor.<br><br>You need to configure over-receipt functionality on the items purchased.<br><br>In which two places should you configure the over-receipt functionality? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Implantas Business Central. La empresa necesita recibir más cantidad de la pedida a un proveedor.<br><br>Debes configurar la funcionalidad de exceso de recepción (over-receipt). ¿En qué dos sitios debes configurarla?","src":"Topic 4 · Q23","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Item card","es":"Item card"},{"id":"B","en":"Vendor card","es":"Vendor card"},{"id":"C","en":"Stockkeeping Unit card","es":"Stockkeeping Unit card"},{"id":"D","en":"Over-Receipt code list","es":"Over-Receipt code list"}],"select":2},{"id":"t4q24","type":"hotspot","en":"A company implements Dynamics 365 Business Central. You record the following vendor ledger entries for a vendor. You record dates by using the following format: month/date/year.<br><br>The company takes advantage of any payment discounts. You use the Suggest Vendor Payments batch job in the Payment Journal to identify payments that must be made. You ensure that any available payment discounts will be automatically subtracted from the amount to be paid to the vendor.<br><br>You need to ensure that the invoices and credit memos for the vendor are included in the results of the Suggest Vendor Payments batch job.<br><br>Which report filters should you use? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.<br><br><table class=\"qtable\"><thead><tr><th>Posting date</th><th>Document type</th><th>Document number</th><th>Amount</th><th>Due date</th><th>Payment discount date</th><th>Payment discount tolerance date</th><th>Payment discount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>01/15/21</td><td>Invoice</td><td>PI001</td><td>-$500.00</td><td>02/15/21</td><td>02/15/21</td><td>02/15/21</td><td>-$0.00</td></tr><tr><td>02/22/21</td><td>Invoice</td><td>PI002</td><td>-$1,000.00</td><td>03/22/21</td><td>03/01/21</td><td>03/03/21</td><td>-$20.00</td></tr><tr><td>01/08/21</td><td>Credit Memo</td><td>PC001</td><td>$125.00</td><td>02/08/21</td><td>02/08/21</td><td>02/08/21</td><td>$0.00</td></tr><tr><td>01/12/21</td><td>Credit Memo</td><td>PC002</td><td>$895.00</td><td>03/12/21</td><td>01/20/21</td><td>01/22/21</td><td>$17.90</td></tr><tr><td>02/20/21</td><td>Invoice</td><td>PI003</td><td>-$75.00</td><td>03/20/21</td><td>02/27/21</td><td>03/01/21</td><td>-$1.50</td></tr></tbody></table>","es":"Registras los movimientos de proveedor de la tabla (fechas en formato mes/día/año). La empresa aprovecha todos los descuentos por pronto pago. Usas <b>Suggest Vendor Payments</b> en el Payment Journal y quieres que los descuentos se resten automáticamente.<br><br>¿Qué filtros del informe debes usar para que se incluyan las facturas y abonos indicados?<br><br><table class=\"qtable\"><thead><tr><th>Posting date</th><th>Document type</th><th>Document number</th><th>Amount</th><th>Due date</th><th>Payment discount date</th><th>Payment discount tolerance date</th><th>Payment discount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>01/15/21</td><td>Invoice</td><td>PI001</td><td>-$500.00</td><td>02/15/21</td><td>02/15/21</td><td>02/15/21</td><td>-$0.00</td></tr><tr><td>02/22/21</td><td>Invoice</td><td>PI002</td><td>-$1,000.00</td><td>03/22/21</td><td>03/01/21</td><td>03/03/21</td><td>-$20.00</td></tr><tr><td>01/08/21</td><td>Credit Memo</td><td>PC001</td><td>$125.00</td><td>02/08/21</td><td>02/08/21</td><td>02/08/21</td><td>$0.00</td></tr><tr><td>01/12/21</td><td>Credit Memo</td><td>PC002</td><td>$895.00</td><td>03/12/21</td><td>01/20/21</td><td>01/22/21</td><td>$17.90</td></tr><tr><td>02/20/21</td><td>Invoice</td><td>PI003</td><td>-$75.00</td><td>03/20/21</td><td>02/27/21</td><td>03/01/21</td><td>-$1.50</td></tr></tbody></table>","src":"Topic 4 · Q24","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Report filter"],"rows":[{"en":"Suggest payment of invoice PI001 on 02/28/21.","es":"Proponer el pago de la factura PI001 el 28/02/21.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Last Payment Date = 02/28/21","es":"Last Payment Date = 02/28/21"},{"id":"b","en":"Last Payment Date = 02/14/21","es":"Last Payment Date = 02/14/21"},{"id":"c","en":"Available Amount (LCY) = 400.00","es":"Available Amount (LCY) = 400.00"},{"id":"d","en":"Calculate Posting Date from Applies-to-Doc. Due Date = yes","es":"Calculate Posting Date from Applies-to-Doc. Due Date = yes"}]},{"en":"Suggest a refund of credit memo PC001 on 02/28/21.","es":"Proponer el reembolso del abono PC001 el 28/02/21.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Last Payment Date = 02/28/21; Posting Date = 02/28/21","es":"Last Payment Date = 02/28/21; Posting Date = 02/28/21"},{"id":"b","en":"Last Payment Date = 02/10/21; Posting Date = 02/28/21","es":"Last Payment Date = 02/10/21; Posting Date = 02/28/21"},{"id":"c","en":"Last Payment Date = 01/31/21; Posting Date = 02/28/21","es":"Last Payment Date = 01/31/21; Posting Date = 02/28/21"},{"id":"d","en":"No filters are available for credit memos; therefore, they are not taken into account.","es":"No filters are available for credit memos; therefore, they are not taken into account."}]},{"en":"Suggest payment of invoices PI002 and PI003 where payment discount is deducted.","es":"Proponer el pago de PI002 y PI003 descontando el pronto pago.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Find Payment Discounts = no; Last Payment Date = 04/01/21; Posting Date = 02/25/21","es":"Find Payment Discounts = no; Last Payment Date = 04/01/21; Posting Date = 02/25/21"},{"id":"b","en":"Find Payment Discounts = no; Last Payment Date = 02/28/21; Posting Date = 02/28/21","es":"Find Payment Discounts = no; Last Payment Date = 02/28/21; Posting Date = 02/28/21"},{"id":"c","en":"Find Payment Discounts = yes; Last Payment Date = 04/01/21; Posting Date = 02/28/21","es":"Find Payment Discounts = yes; Last Payment Date = 04/01/21; Posting Date = 02/28/21"},{"id":"d","en":"Find Payment Discounts = yes; Last Payment Date = 04/01/21; Posting Date = 02/25/21","es":"Find Payment Discounts = yes; Last Payment Date = 04/01/21; Posting Date = 02/25/21"}]}]},{"id":"t4q25","type":"drag","en":"You are performing actions on posted sales invoices.<br><br>You need to correct any identified errors.<br><br>Which actions should you perform? To answer, drag the action buttons to the correct requirements. Each action button may be used once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Trabajas con facturas de venta registradas y debes corregir los errores detectados.<br><br>¿Qué acción corresponde a cada requisito? Cada una puede usarse una vez o ninguna.","src":"Topic 4 · Q25","valuesTitle":"Action buttons","targetHeader":["Requirement","Action button"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Correct","es":"Correct"},{"id":"V2","en":"Cancel","es":"Cancel"},{"id":"V3","en":"Create Corrective Credit Memo","es":"Create Corrective Credit Memo"}],"targets":[{"en":"Cancel and reverse a posted invoice and automatically create a new invoice with the same information.","es":"Anular una factura registrada y crear automáticamente otra con los mismos datos."},{"en":"Create and post a sales credit memo that cancels and reverses a posted sales invoice.","es":"Crear y registrar un abono que anule la factura registrada."},{"en":"Create a credit memo for a posted invoice that you complete and post manually to reverse the posted invoice.","es":"Crear un abono que se completa y registra manualmente."}]},{"id":"t4q27","type":"mc","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a company. The accounting manager provides you the chart of accounts. You are setting up the posting groups for the accounting department.<br><br>You must use a standard costing method and post any differences between actual purchase costs and the standard cost.<br><br>You need to set up a general ledger account for posting any differences in costs.<br><br>What should you use?","es":"Implantas Business Central. Con el plan de cuentas del responsable de contabilidad configuras los posting groups.<br><br>Debes usar el coste estándar y registrar las diferencias entre el coste real de compra y el coste estándar. ¿Qué debes usar para definir la cuenta de esas diferencias?","src":"Topic 4 · Q27","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Gen. Business Posting Groups","es":"Gen. Business Posting Groups"},{"id":"B","en":"General Posting Setup","es":"General Posting Setup"},{"id":"C","en":"Vendor Posting Groups","es":"Vendor Posting Groups"},{"id":"D","en":"Inventory Posting Groups","es":"Inventory Posting Groups"}]},{"id":"t4q28","type":"hotspot","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to ensure that the company can bulk edit data by using the Edit in Excel feature.<br><br>What should you use? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"La empresa quiere editar datos en bloque con <b>Edit in Excel</b>.<br><br>¿Qué debes usar en cada caso?","src":"Topic 4 · Q28","rowsHeader":["Action","Configuration"],"rows":[{"en":"Install the Edit in Excel feature.","es":"Instalar Edit in Excel.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Office Add-ins","es":"Office Add-ins"},{"id":"b","en":"AppSource","es":"AppSource"},{"id":"c","en":"Business Central","es":"Business Central"},{"id":"d","en":"Lifecycle Services","es":"Lifecycle Services"}]},{"en":"Link the feature to the Business Central instance.","es":"Vincular la funcionalidad con Business Central.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"https://appsource.microsoft.com/","es":"https://appsource.microsoft.com/"},{"id":"b","en":"https://businesscentral.dynamics.com/","es":"https://businesscentral.dynamics.com/"},{"id":"c","en":"https://exceladdinprovider.smb.dynamics.com/","es":"https://exceladdinprovider.smb.dynamics.com/"},{"id":"d","en":"https://businesscentral.dynamics.com/[UsersSpecificInstanceId]","es":"https://businesscentral.dynamics.com/[UsersSpecificInstanceId]"}]}]},{"id":"t4q29","type":"hotspot","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central to manage accounts payables. The company uses exact cost reversing when returning products to vendors.<br><br>Returns use current costs at the time of the return. Exact cost reversing must be enforced manually for current orders and automatically applied to all future orders.<br><br>You need to configure the system.<br><br>Which configuration options should you use? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"La empresa usa exact cost reversing en las devoluciones a proveedores. Debe aplicarse manualmente en los pedidos actuales y automáticamente en todos los futuros.<br><br>¿Qué opción corresponde a cada requisito?","src":"Topic 4 · Q29","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Configuration option"],"rows":[{"en":"Automatically conduct exact cost reversing for all new PO returns.","es":"Aplicar automáticamente exact cost reversing en todas las devoluciones nuevas.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Copy Item from Item No","es":"Copy Item from Item No"},{"id":"b","en":"Exact Cost Reversing Mandatory","es":"Exact Cost Reversing Mandatory"},{"id":"c","en":"Get Posted Document Lines to Reverse","es":"Get Posted Document Lines to Reverse"},{"id":"d","en":"Automatic cost posting","es":"Automatic cost posting"}]},{"en":"Manually conduct exact cost reversing on the individual return document line to reference the original purchase entry.","es":"Aplicarlo manualmente en una línea de devolución, referenciando la entrada de compra original.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Apply entries","es":"Apply entries"},{"id":"b","en":"Reverse transaction","es":"Reverse transaction"},{"id":"c","en":"Appl.-from Item Entry","es":"Appl.-from Item Entry"},{"id":"d","en":"Get Return Shipment Lines","es":"Get Return Shipment Lines"}]}]},{"id":"t4q30","type":"mc","en":"A company is negotiating with a vendor for better prices on several items. The company has made late payments to the vendor in the past.<br><br>You need to configure the system to help ensure that all future payments will be made on time.<br><br>What should you do?","es":"Una empresa negocia mejores precios con un proveedor al que en el pasado ha pagado tarde.<br><br>Debes configurar el sistema para que los pagos futuros se hagan a tiempo. ¿Qué debes hacer?","src":"Topic 4 · Q30","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Set the vendor's Priority field to 0 and create a workflow for generating vendor payments.","es":"Poner Priority = 0 en el proveedor y crear un workflow que genere los pagos."},{"id":"B","en":"Set the vendor's Priority field to 1 and enable the Late Payment Predictions extension.","es":"Poner Priority = 1 y activar la extensión Late Payment Prediction."},{"id":"C","en":"Set the vendor's Priority field to 1 and run the Suggest Vendor Payments process.","es":"Poner Priority = 1 en el proveedor y ejecutar Suggest Vendor Payments."},{"id":"D","en":"Set the Application Method to Apply to Oldest and run the Suggest Vendor Payments process.","es":"Poner Application Method = Apply to Oldest y ejecutar Suggest Vendor Payments."},{"id":"E","en":"Set the vendor's Priority field to 0 and run the Suggest Vendor Payments process.","es":"Poner Priority = 0 en el proveedor y ejecutar Suggest Vendor Payments."}]},{"id":"t4q32","type":"mr","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a customer.<br><br>You need to explain the primary functions of the Adjust Cost - Item Entries batch job.<br><br>What are three primary purposes of the Adjust Cost - Item Entries batch job? Each correct answer presents part of the complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Implantas Business Central y debes explicar las funciones principales del proceso <b>Adjust Cost – Item Entries</b>.<br><br>¿Cuáles son sus tres objetivos principales?","src":"Topic 4 · Q32","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Establish the earliest possible posting date for the Post Inventory to G/L process.","es":"Establecer la fecha de registro más temprana posible para el proceso Post Inventory to G/L."},{"id":"B","en":"Adjust the item quantity.","es":"Ajustar la cantidad del producto."},{"id":"C","en":"Calculate the correct cost of the sale of an item, according to an item's costing method.","es":"Calcular el coste correcto de la venta de un producto según su método de coste."},{"id":"D","en":"Update the cost of goods sold (COGS) for historic sales entries.","es":"Actualizar el coste de ventas (COGS) de las ventas ya registradas."},{"id":"E","en":"Adjust the item tracking.","es":"Ajustar el seguimiento de producto (item tracking)."}],"select":3},{"id":"t4q33","type":"mr","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a company.<br><br>The company often invoices multiple shipments on one invoice.<br><br>You need to train the accounting staff how to process these sales invoices.<br><br>In which two ways should you train the staff to create invoices? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"La empresa factura a menudo varios envíos en una sola factura.<br><br>¿De qué dos formas debes enseñar a contabilidad a crear estas facturas?","src":"Topic 4 · Q33","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Use the Combine Shipments batch job to automatically create and post sales invoices and credit memos.","es":"Usar el proceso Combine Shipments para crear y registrar automáticamente facturas y abonos."},{"id":"B","en":"Create a new invoice for the Bill-to-Customer. Use the Get Shipment Lines action to select all the shipments from different sales orders and Sell-to-Customers.","es":"Crear una factura para el Bill-to Customer y usar Get Shipment Lines para seleccionar envíos de distintos pedidos y distintos Sell-to Customers."},{"id":"C","en":"Use the Combine Shipments batch job to automatically create sales invoices and delete completed sales orders.","es":"Usar Combine Shipments para crear facturas y borrar los pedidos completados."},{"id":"D","en":"Create a new invoice for the Sell-to Customer. Use the Get Shipment Lines action to select all the shipments from different sales orders, in the same currency.","es":"Crear una factura para el Sell-to Customer y usar Get Shipment Lines para seleccionar envíos de distintos pedidos en la misma divisa."},{"id":"E","en":"Use the Combine Shipments batch job to automatically create, post, and print sales invoices.","es":"Usar Combine Shipments para crear, registrar e imprimir automáticamente las facturas."}],"select":2},{"id":"t4q34","type":"mr","en":"You are using the Suggest Vendor Payments batch job to create payment lines for vendors.<br><br>You have a vendor invoice. The payment date must be two days before the invoice due date.<br><br>You need to pay the purchase invoice.<br><br>Which two fields should you configure? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Usas <b>Suggest Vendor Payments</b> para crear líneas de pago. Tienes una factura de proveedor que debe pagarse dos días antes de su vencimiento.<br><br>¿Qué dos campos debes configurar?","src":"Topic 4 · Q34","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Find Payment Discounts","es":"Find Payment Discounts"},{"id":"B","en":"Calculate Posting Date from Applies-to-Doc Due Date","es":"Calculate Posting Date from Applies-to-Doc Due Date"},{"id":"C","en":"Applies-to-Doc Due Date Offset","es":"Applies-to-Doc Due Date Offset"},{"id":"D","en":"Summarize per Vendor","es":"Summarize per Vendor"}],"select":2},{"id":"t4q35","type":"mr","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>An accountant posts bank entries at month end. The accountant must manually reconcile customer and vendor payment entries.<br><br>You need to reconcile the entries.<br><br>Which two pages should you use? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Un contable registra los movimientos bancarios a fin de mes y debe conciliar manualmente los pagos de clientes y proveedores.<br><br>¿Qué dos páginas debes usar?","src":"Topic 4 · Q35","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Check Ledger Entries","es":"Check Ledger Entries"},{"id":"B","en":"Vendor Ledger Entries","es":"Vendor Ledger Entries"},{"id":"C","en":"Customer Ledger Entries","es":"Customer Ledger Entries"},{"id":"D","en":"Bank Account Ledger Entries","es":"Bank Account Ledger Entries"}],"select":2},{"id":"t4q37","type":"hotspot","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company plans to process purchase order documents based on the following requirements:<ul><li>The system must automatically archive purchase order documents.</li><li>The system must ensure the default value of the quantity received on a purchase order is set to the remaining quantity on the purchase order.</li></ul>You need to configure purchases and payables options.<br><br>Which tools should you use? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"La empresa necesita que los pedidos de compra se archiven automáticamente y que la cantidad a recibir propuesta sea la cantidad pendiente.<br><br>¿Qué opción de Purchases & Payables Setup corresponde a cada requisito?","src":"Topic 4 · Q37","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Tool"],"rows":[{"en":"Automatically archive purchase order documents.","es":"Archivar automáticamente los pedidos de compra.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Archive Quotes","es":"Archive Quotes"},{"id":"b","en":"Archive Orders","es":"Archive Orders"},{"id":"c","en":"Archive Blanket Orders","es":"Archive Blanket Orders"},{"id":"d","en":"Archive Return Orders","es":"Archive Return Orders"}]},{"en":"Ensure the quantity received on a purchase order is set to the remaining quantity.","es":"Proponer como cantidad a recibir la cantidad pendiente.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Default Qty. to Receive","es":"Default Qty. to Receive"},{"id":"b","en":"Exact Cost Reversing Mandatory","es":"Exact Cost Reversing Mandatory"},{"id":"c","en":"Default Posting Date","es":"Default Posting Date"},{"id":"d","en":"Document Default Line Type","es":"Document Default Line Type"}]}]},{"id":"t4q38","type":"hotspot","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The purchasing department needs to use over-receipts in the system.<br><br>You need to describe how to set up this functionality.<br><br>What should you use? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area,<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"El departamento de compras quiere usar over-receipts (recepciones de más).<br><br>¿En qué página se configura cada elemento?","src":"Topic 4 · Q38","rowsHeader":["Feature","Page"],"rows":[{"en":"Over-receipt code setting","es":"Over-receipt code setting","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Inventory Setup","es":"Inventory Setup"},{"id":"b","en":"Location Card","es":"Location Card"},{"id":"c","en":"Item Card","es":"Item Card"}]},{"en":"Over-Receipt Tolerance %","es":"Over-Receipt Tolerance %","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Inventory Setup","es":"Inventory Setup"},{"id":"b","en":"Over-Receipt Codes","es":"Over-Receipt Codes"},{"id":"c","en":"Item Card","es":"Item Card"}]},{"en":"Approval required for over-receipt purchase quantity","es":"Aprobación obligatoria de la cantidad recibida de más","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Inventory Setup","es":"Inventory Setup"},{"id":"b","en":"Over-Receipt Codes","es":"Over-Receipt Codes"},{"id":"c","en":"Item Card","es":"Item Card"}]}]},{"id":"t4q40","type":"mc","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The finance manager requires a rule that prevents application of the payment to the sales invoice if a user sells to a customer in one currency but receives payment in a different currency.<br><br>You need to set up the rule for the currency application.<br><br>Which page should you configure?","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central. El responsable financiero quiere impedir que un cobro se aplique a una factura de venta si se vendió en una divisa y se cobró en otra.<br><br>¿Qué página debes configurar?","src":"Topic 4 · Q40","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Sales &amp; Receivables Setup","es":"Sales & Receivables Setup"},{"id":"B","en":"General Ledger Setup","es":"General Ledger Setup"},{"id":"C","en":"Customer Card","es":"Customer Card"},{"id":"D","en":"Bank Account Card","es":"Bank Account Card"},{"id":"E","en":"Currencies","es":"Currencies"}]},{"id":"t4q41","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central. The company works with physical goods.<br><br>The system must automatically populate the Type field on the document line when a user creates a purchase order.<br><br>You need to configure the system.<br><br>Solution: On the Purchases &amp; Payables Setup page, set the default document line type to Item.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Una empresa usa Business Central y trabaja con productos físicos. Al crear un pedido de compra, el sistema debe rellenar automáticamente el campo <b>Type</b> de las líneas.<br><br>Debes configurar el sistema.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> en <b>Purchases & Payables Setup</b>, poner el tipo de línea predeterminado (Document Default Line Type) en Item.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q41","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q42","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central. The company works with physical goods.<br><br>The system must automatically populate the Type field on the document line when a user creates a purchase order.<br><br>You need to configure the system.<br><br>Solution: On the User Setup page, define invoice posting policies.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Una empresa usa Business Central y trabaja con productos físicos. Al crear un pedido de compra, el sistema debe rellenar automáticamente el campo <b>Type</b> de las líneas.<br><br>Debes configurar el sistema.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> en la página <b>User Setup</b>, definir políticas de registro de facturas (invoice posting policies).<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q42","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q43","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central. The company works with physical goods.<br><br>The system must automatically populate the Type field on the document line when a user creates a purchase order.<br><br>You need to configure the system.<br><br>Solution: On the Report Selection - Purchase page, select a purchase order document type, and then select a custom report.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Una empresa usa Business Central y trabaja con productos físicos. Al crear un pedido de compra, el sistema debe rellenar automáticamente el campo <b>Type</b> de las líneas.<br><br>Debes configurar el sistema.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> en <b>Report Selection – Purchase</b>, elegir el tipo de documento pedido de compra y seleccionar un informe personalizado.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q43","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q47","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central. The company works with physical goods.<br><br>The system must automatically populate the Type field on the document line when a user creates a purchase order.<br><br>You need to configure the system.<br><br>Solution: On the Vendor Card page, select a document layout and then select a custom layout for reports.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Una empresa usa Business Central y trabaja con productos físicos. Al crear un pedido de compra, el sistema debe rellenar automáticamente el campo <b>Type</b> de las líneas.<br><br>Debes configurar el sistema.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> en la ficha del proveedor, seleccionar Document Layouts y elegir un diseño personalizado para los informes.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q47","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q48","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>Functional users at the company must learn the data model behind pages to assist with troubleshooting.<br><br>You need to explain what users can inspect by using the Page Inspection pane.<br><br>Solution: View page and subpage information such as name, ID, and type.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Una empresa usa Business Central. Los usuarios funcionales deben conocer el modelo de datos de las páginas para ayudar a resolver incidencias.<br><br>Debes explicar qué pueden consultar con el panel <b>Page Inspection</b>.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> ver información de la página y sus subpáginas, como nombre, ID y tipo.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q48","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q49","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>Functional users at the company must learn the data model behind pages to assist with troubleshooting.<br><br>You need to explain what users can inspect by using the Page Inspection pane.<br><br>Solution: View filters set by code on the current page.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Una empresa usa Business Central. Los usuarios funcionales deben conocer el modelo de datos de las páginas para ayudar a resolver incidencias.<br><br>Debes explicar qué pueden consultar con el panel <b>Page Inspection</b>.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> ver los filtros establecidos por código en la página actual.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q49","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q50","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>Functional users at the company must learn the data model behind pages to assist with troubleshooting.<br><br>You need to explain what users can inspect by using the Page Inspection pane.<br><br>Solution: View table and table fields.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Una empresa usa Business Central. Los usuarios funcionales deben conocer el modelo de datos de las páginas para ayudar a resolver incidencias.<br><br>Debes explicar qué pueden consultar con el panel <b>Page Inspection</b>.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> ver la tabla y sus campos.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q50","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t4q52","type":"drag","en":"A company is implementing Business Central. The company is evaluating Microsoft Power Platform integration benefits.<br><br>The company has the following business requirements:<ul><li>Provide financial reporting in real-time.</li><li>Automate customer onboarding in Business Central.</li><li>Create a workflow that automates invoice approvals.</li><li>Integrate item scanning capabilities in the warehouse.</li></ul>You need to evaluate the specified business requirements and align them with Microsoft solutions that can meet each need effectively.<br><br>Which Microsoft Power Platform tools should you recommend? To answer, move the appropriate business Microsoft Power Platform tools to the correct requirements. You may use each Microsoft Power Platform tool once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to move the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa necesita: informes financieros en tiempo real, alta automatizada de clientes, un flujo que automatice la aprobación de facturas y escaneo de artículos en el almacén.<br><br>¿Qué herramienta de Microsoft Power Platform recomiendas para cada requisito? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 4 · Q52","valuesTitle":"Microsoft Power Platform tools","targetHeader":["Business requirement","Microsoft Power Platform tool"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"OneDrive","es":"OneDrive"},{"id":"V2","en":"Power Apps","es":"Power Apps"},{"id":"V3","en":"Power Automate","es":"Power Automate"},{"id":"V4","en":"Power BI","es":"Power BI"}],"targets":[{"en":"Real-time financial reporting","es":"Informes financieros en tiempo real"},{"en":"Automated customer onboarding","es":"Alta automatizada de clientes"},{"en":"Automated invoice approval workflow","es":"Flujo automatizado de aprobación de facturas"},{"en":"Integrated item scanning capabilities","es":"Escaneo de artículos integrado"}]},{"id":"t4q53","type":"mc","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company must be able to control the periods when users will post deferrals in the system.<br><br>You need to configure the system.<br><br>From which page should you configure the system?","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central y debe poder controlar los periodos en que los usuarios registran diferimientos (deferrals).<br><br>¿Desde qué página debes configurarlo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q53","options":[{"id":"A","en":"User tasks","es":"User tasks"},{"id":"B","en":"User Card","es":"User Card"},{"id":"C","en":"User Setup","es":"User Setup"},{"id":"D","en":"Deferral Template Card","es":"Deferral Template Card"}]},{"id":"t4q55","type":"mc","en":"A heavy equipment dealership is implementing Business Central<br><br>The client has the following requirements:<ul><li>Track accounts receivable for parts and equipment sales in different G/L accounts.</li><li>Track interest for parts and equipment sales in different G/L accounts.</li><li>Use the same customer card for both parts and equipment sales.</li></ul>You enable the Allow multiple posting groups toggle on the Sales &amp; Receivables Setup page.<br><br>You need to specify alternative posting groups.<br><br>Where should you specify alternative posting groups?","es":"Un concesionario de maquinaria pesada implanta Business Central y necesita:<ul><li>Llevar las cuentas a cobrar de recambios y de equipos en cuentas distintas.</li><li>Llevar los intereses de recambios y equipos en cuentas distintas.</li><li>Usar la misma ficha de cliente para ambas ventas.</li></ul>Activas <b>Allow multiple posting groups</b> en Sales & Receivables Setup.<br><br>¿Dónde debes indicar los posting groups alternativos?","src":"Topic 4 · Q55","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Customer Card","es":"Customer Card"},{"id":"B","en":"Gen. Business Posting Group","es":"Gen. Business Posting Group"},{"id":"C","en":"Customer Posting Group","es":"Customer Posting Group"},{"id":"D","en":"Sales &amp; Receivable Setup page","es":"Sales & Receivable Setup page"}]},{"id":"t4q56","type":"mc","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company must be able to control the periods when users will post deferrals in the system.<br><br>You need to configure the system.<br><br>From which page should you configure the system?","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central y debe poder controlar los periodos en que los usuarios registran diferimientos (deferrals).<br><br>¿Desde qué página debes configurarlo?","src":"Topic 4 · Q56","options":[{"id":"A","en":"User tasks","es":"User tasks"},{"id":"B","en":"My Settings","es":"My Settings"},{"id":"C","en":"User Setup","es":"User Setup"},{"id":"D","en":"Profiles (Roles)","es":"Profiles (Roles)"}]},{"id":"t4q57","type":"hotspot","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company has the following purchasing requirements:<ul><li>Ensure that the costs on credit memos match the costs from the originating invoices.</li><li>Process the shipment document of a return at the same time the credit memo is posted.</li></ul>You need to set up purchase and payables.<br><br>Which settings should you configure? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"La empresa necesita que el coste de los abonos de compra coincida con el de las facturas originales y que el envío de devolución se registre a la vez que el abono.<br><br>¿Qué configuración de Purchases & Payables corresponde a cada requisito?","src":"Topic 4 · Q57","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Configuration"],"rows":[{"en":"Ensure the costs on credit memos match the costs from the originating invoices.","es":"Que el coste de los abonos coincida con el de las facturas originales.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Enable the Exact Cost Reversing Mandatory setting.","es":"Enable the Exact Cost Reversing Mandatory setting."},{"id":"b","en":"Select Remainder for the Default Quantity to Receive setting.","es":"Select Remainder for the Default Quantity to Receive setting."},{"id":"c","en":"Enable the Exact Document No Mandatory setting.","es":"Enable the Exact Document No Mandatory setting."}]},{"en":"Process the shipment document of a return at the same time the credit memo is posted.","es":"Registrar el envío de devolución a la vez que el abono.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Set the Default Qty. to Receive setting to Remainder.","es":"Set the Default Qty. to Receive setting to Remainder."},{"id":"b","en":"Enable the Return Receipt on Credit Memo setting.","es":"Enable the Return Receipt on Credit Memo setting."},{"id":"c","en":"Enable the Receipt on Invoice setting.","es":"Enable the Receipt on Invoice setting."}]}]},{"id":"t4q58","type":"mc","en":"A company is implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company has service vehicles that will be fixed assets in Business Central. All costs must be allocated 20% to Administration and 80% to the Service department.<br><br>You need to process fixed asset transactions to allocate costs as specified.<br><br>Which posting must you allocate manually?","es":"Una empresa implanta Business Central. Sus vehículos de servicio serán activos fijos. Todos los costes deben repartirse un 20 % a Administración y un 80 % al departamento de Servicio.<br><br>¿Qué registro debes repartir manualmente?","src":"Topic 4 · Q58","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Acquisition cost","es":"Acquisition cost"},{"id":"B","en":"Maintenance cost","es":"Maintenance cost"},{"id":"C","en":"Depreciation cost","es":"Depreciation cost"},{"id":"D","en":"Loss on disposal","es":"Loss on disposal"}]},{"id":"s4q5","type":"build","en":"You complete Payment Registration setup. The following options are enabled:<ul><li>Use this account as default</li><li>Auto Fill Date received</li></ul>You need to process a single full payment from a customer against the amounts due for two invoices by using customer payment registration.<br><br>What four actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"Has configurado Payment Registration con <i>Use this account as default</i> y <i>Auto Fill Date Received</i> activadas.<br><br>Debes registrar un único pago completo de un cliente que cubre dos facturas. ¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q5","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"In the Date Received field, enter the date when the payment was made","es":"Introducir la fecha del pago en Date Received."},{"id":"B","en":"In the Amount Received field, enter amounts","es":"Introducir los importes en Amount Received."},{"id":"C","en":"Select the Payment Made option for lines that represent the second invoice","es":"Marcar Payment Made en la segunda factura."},{"id":"D","en":"Select Post Payments","es":"Seleccionar Post Payments."},{"id":"E","en":"Open Payment Registration","es":"Abrir Payment Registration."},{"id":"F","en":"Select the Payment Made option for lines that represent the first invoice","es":"Marcar Payment Made en la primera factura."},{"id":"G","en":"Select Post As Lump Payment","es":"Seleccionar Post As Lump Payment."}]},{"id":"s4q8","type":"build","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company's funds are limited and some invoices that are due cannot be paid on time.<br><br>You need to prioritize vendors when you suggest vendor payments.<br><br>Which three actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"Los fondos son limitados y no todas las facturas vencidas pueden pagarse a tiempo.<br><br>Debes priorizar proveedores al proponer pagos. ¿Qué tres acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q8","slots":3,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Select Summarize per Vendor when you run the Suggest Vendor Payments batch job.","es":"Marcar Summarize per Vendor al ejecutar Suggest Vendor Payments."},{"id":"B","en":"Set Vendor Priority on the Vendor card using the lowest number, except zero, for the highest priority.","es":"Indicar la prioridad en la ficha del proveedor (el número más bajo, salvo 0, es la máxima)."},{"id":"C","en":"Select Use Vendor Priority when you run the Suggest Vendor Payments batch job.","es":"Marcar Use Vendor Priority al ejecutar Suggest Vendor Payments."},{"id":"D","en":"Filter by Available Amount when you run the Suggest Vendor Payments batch job.","es":"Filtrar por Available Amount al ejecutar el proceso."},{"id":"E","en":"Enter Available Amount (LCY) when you run the Suggest Vendor Payments batch job.","es":"Introducir Available Amount (LCY) al ejecutar el proceso."}]},{"id":"s4q11","type":"build","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a company.<br><br>The company must perform inventory valuation according to the following business rules:<ul><li>Include received items that are not yet invoiced on balance sheets.</li><li>Lock inventory value by closing the month.</li></ul>You need to recommend a process for the company's accounting department to use.<br><br>Which three actions should you recommend be performed in sequence?","es":"La valoración del inventario debe incluir en el balance lo recibido y no facturado y bloquear el valor cerrando el mes.<br><br>¿Qué tres acciones recomiendas y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q11","slots":3,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Perform the Post Inventory Cost to G/L batch job","es":"Ejecutar Post Inventory Cost to G/L."},{"id":"B","en":"Close the inventory period","es":"Cerrar el periodo de inventario."},{"id":"C","en":"Include Expected Cost on the Inventory Valuation report","es":"Incluir Expected Cost en el informe Inventory Valuation."},{"id":"D","en":"Perform the Adjust Cost - Item entries batch job","es":"Ejecutar Adjust Cost - Item Entries."},{"id":"E","en":"Update Standard Cost","es":"Actualizar el coste estándar."}]},{"id":"s4q12","type":"build","en":"The accounts payable department of a company processes purchase invoices throughout the month. A vendor sends an invoice at the end of each week that combines all deliveries.<br><br>The company wants to know how to process this invoice.<br><br>You need to explain the steps involved in purchase invoicing.<br><br>In which order should the steps be performed? To answer, move all actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Un proveedor envía cada semana una factura que agrupa todas las entregas.<br><br>¿En qué orden deben realizarse todos los pasos para procesarla?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q12","slots":5,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Create a new purchase invoice for the vendor and use the Get Receipt Lines action.","es":"Crear una factura de compra nueva y usar Get Receipt Lines."},{"id":"B","en":"Delete fully invoiced purchase orders.","es":"Eliminar los pedidos totalmente facturados."},{"id":"C","en":"On the purchase invoice lines, make the necessary adjustments for example regarding received quantity or prices.","es":"Ajustar en las líneas de la factura cantidades o precios."},{"id":"D","en":"From each purchase order, post receipts for the items","es":"Registrar las recepciones desde cada pedido."},{"id":"E","en":"Post the purchase invoice","es":"Registrar la factura de compra."}]},{"id":"s4q13","type":"build","en":"You are a functional consultant working on purchase returns in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>A customer orders 100 pieces of an item from a vendor. After receiving them into inventory and posting the invoice, the customer determines that only 50 pieces are needed.<br><br>You create a purchase return order to return 50 pieces of the item. The vendor has authorized the return.<br><br>You need to apply the return to the original purchase.<br><br>Which five actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"Un cliente compró 100 unidades, las recibió y registró la factura, pero solo necesita 50. Has creado un pedido de devolución de compra de 50 unidades, autorizado por el proveedor.<br><br>Debes aplicar la devolución a la compra original. ¿Qué cinco acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q13","slots":5,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Post the purchase return order","es":"Registrar el pedido de devolución."},{"id":"B","en":"Set the purchase return order's item line Quantity to 50 pieces","es":"Poner la cantidad de la línea en 50."},{"id":"C","en":"Set the Document Type filter to Posted Invoices and select the correct line","es":"Filtrar por Posted Invoices y seleccionar la línea."},{"id":"D","en":"Run the Copy Document... function","es":"Ejecutar Copy Document."},{"id":"E","en":"Run the Get Posted Doc... to Reverse... function","es":"Ejecutar Get Posted Document Lines to Reverse."},{"id":"F","en":"Enable the Return Original Quantity option","es":"Activar Return Original Quantity."},{"id":"G","en":"Enable the Show Reversible Lines Only option","es":"Activar Show Reversible Lines Only."}]},{"id":"s4q21","type":"build","en":"You are creating a filtered view of a Chart of Accounts page.<br><br>The page must be filtered to display Net Change values only for transactions between a specific date range. You must save the filtered view for future use.<br><br>You need to filter on transactions occurring between January 1, 2020 and January 31, 2020.<br><br>Which three actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Creas una vista filtrada del Chart of Accounts que muestre Net Change (saldo del periodo) solo para un rango de fechas y quieres guardarla.<br><br>Debes filtrar las transacciones entre el 1 y el 31 de enero de 2020. ¿Qué tres acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q21","slots":3,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Set the date range to <b>01/01/20|01/31/20</b> and save the view.","es":"Poner el rango <b>01/01/20|01/31/20</b> y guardar la vista."},{"id":"B","en":"Select <b>Date Filter</b>.","es":"Seleccionar <b>Date Filter</b>."},{"id":"C","en":"Add a <b>Filter totals by</b> filter.","es":"Añadir un filtro en <b>Filter totals by</b>."},{"id":"D","en":"Select <b>Net Change</b>.","es":"Seleccionar <b>Net Change</b>."},{"id":"E","en":"Set the date range to <b>01/01/20..01/31/20</b> and save the view.","es":"Poner el rango <b>01/01/20..01/31/20</b> y guardar la vista."},{"id":"F","en":"Add a <b>Filter list by</b> filter.","es":"Añadir un filtro en <b>Filter list by</b>."}]},{"id":"s4q22","type":"build","en":"You need to undo an incorrectly posted purchase receipt from a related purchase order.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"Debes deshacer una recepción de compra registrada por error desde su pedido de compra.<br><br>¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q22","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Select Undo Receipt.","es":"Seleccionar Undo Receipt."},{"id":"B","en":"Change the status of the purchase order from Release to Open.","es":"Cambiar el estado del pedido de Released a Open."},{"id":"C","en":"Select Cancel.","es":"Seleccionar Cancel."},{"id":"D","en":"Choose Receipts and then open the incorrectly posted receipts.","es":"Elegir Receipts y abrir la recepción errónea."},{"id":"E","en":"Select a line to be cancelled from the posted purchase receipt.","es":"Seleccionar la línea a deshacer de la recepción registrada."},{"id":"F","en":"Open the purchase order that is with the receipt.","es":"Abrir el pedido de compra de la recepción."}]},{"id":"s4q26","type":"build","en":"You have a sales order with a quantity of 100 items.<br><br>You need to post a shipment with a quantity of 50 items from the sales order.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"Tienes un pedido de venta de 100 unidades y debes registrar un envío de 50.<br><br>¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q26","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Set the Qty. To Ship to 50.","es":"Poner Qty. to Ship en 50."},{"id":"B","en":"Select the Post Batch option.","es":"Seleccionar Post Batch."},{"id":"C","en":"Set the Quantity to 50.","es":"Poner Quantity en 50."},{"id":"D","en":"Select the sales order.","es":"Seleccionar el pedido de venta."},{"id":"E","en":"Choose the Ship option.","es":"Elegir la opción Ship."},{"id":"F","en":"Select Ship and Invoice.","es":"Seleccionar Ship and Invoice."},{"id":"G","en":"Select the Post action.","es":"Seleccionar la acción Post."}]},{"id":"s4q31","type":"build","en":"You are setting up a new company for a customer.<br><br>The customer wants you to filter the view to show all customers in the My Customers list and calculate the year-to-date sales.<br><br>You need to apply the filter.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence? (More than one order of answer choices is correct.)","es":"Un cliente quiere filtrar la lista para ver los clientes de <i>My Customers</i> y calcular las ventas del año hasta la fecha.<br><br>¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q31","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Add the Date Filter as a Filter total. Then enter W-CY..W.","es":"Añadir Date Filter como filtro de totales e introducir W-CY..W."},{"id":"B","en":"Open the filter pane. Then select the No. field and set the filter to %MYCUSTOMERS.","es":"Abrir el panel de filtros y filtrar el campo No. por %MYCUSTOMERS."},{"id":"C","en":"Open the customer list.","es":"Abrir la lista de clientes."},{"id":"D","en":"Add the Date Filter as a Filter total. Enter Y for year.","es":"Añadir Date Filter como filtro de totales e introducir Y."},{"id":"E","en":"Open the customer card.","es":"Abrir la ficha de cliente."},{"id":"F","en":"Save the view by naming it Sales for my customers this year.","es":"Guardar la vista con el nombre Sales for my customers this year."},{"id":"G","en":"Open the filter pane. Then select the No. field and set the filter to all the customer numbers from the My Customers list, separated by a pipe character.","es":"Abrir el panel de filtros y filtrar el campo No. por todos los números de My Customers separados por barras verticales."}]},{"id":"s4q36","type":"build","en":"You need to configure the purchase order process for a company.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"Debes configurar el proceso de pedidos de compra de una empresa.<br><br>¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q36","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Run a Test Report.","es":"Ejecutar un Test Report."},{"id":"B","en":"Add a Purchaser Code.","es":"Añadir un Purchaser Code."},{"id":"C","en":"Select Post and Invoice.","es":"Seleccionar Post and Invoice."},{"id":"D","en":"Add a vendor.","es":"Añadir un proveedor."},{"id":"E","en":"Change the Purchase Order to a Status of Released.","es":"Cambiar el estado del pedido a Released."},{"id":"F","en":"Add Items, including Quantity, to the lines.","es":"Añadir artículos con su cantidad en las líneas."},{"id":"G","en":"Create a warehouse receipt.","es":"Crear una recepción de almacén."},{"id":"H","en":"Select Post and Receive.","es":"Seleccionar Post and Receive."}]},{"id":"s4q39","type":"build","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>A user creates a quote for a contact. The contact accepts the quote.<br><br>The user must convert the quote to a sales fulfillment order.<br><br>You need to demonstrate the conversion process.<br><br>Which three actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"Un usuario crea una oferta para un contacto, que la acepta. Debe convertirla en un pedido de venta.<br><br>¿Qué tres acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q39","slots":3,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Select Make Order to start the conversion process.","es":"Seleccionar Make Order para iniciar la conversión."},{"id":"B","en":"Select Make Invoice to start the conversion process.","es":"Seleccionar Make Invoice para iniciar la conversión."},{"id":"C","en":"Convert contact to customer.","es":"Convertir el contacto en cliente."},{"id":"D","en":"Confirm conversion of the quote.","es":"Confirmar la conversión de la oferta."},{"id":"E","en":"Manually delete the quote.","es":"Eliminar la oferta manualmente."}]},{"id":"s4q51","type":"build","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company requires one entry to apply customer payments to one or many customer invoices and enter the payment in the bank account.<br><br>You need to prepare a cash receipt journal.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"La empresa quiere una sola entrada que aplique cobros de clientes a una o varias facturas y los registre en la cuenta bancaria.<br><br>Debes preparar un diario de cobros. ¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q51","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Select G/L Account as the Balance account type.","es":"Seleccionar G/L Account como tipo de contrapartida."},{"id":"B","en":"Open a cash receipt journal.","es":"Abrir un diario de cobros."},{"id":"C","en":"Apply entries.","es":"Liquidar los movimientos (Apply Entries)."},{"id":"D","en":"Add lines for each customer payment.","es":"Añadir una línea por cada cobro."},{"id":"E","en":"Post the cash receipt journal.","es":"Registrar el diario de cobros."}]},{"id":"s4q54","type":"build","en":"You need to advise a company how to process a purchase order in the system for a company.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"Debes explicar a una empresa cómo procesar un pedido de compra.<br><br>¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q54","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Run a Test Report.","es":"Ejecutar un Test Report."},{"id":"B","en":"Add a Purchaser Code.","es":"Añadir un Purchaser Code."},{"id":"C","en":"Select Post and Invoice.","es":"Seleccionar Post and Invoice."},{"id":"D","en":"Add a vendor.","es":"Añadir un proveedor."},{"id":"E","en":"Change the Purchase Order to a Status of Released.","es":"Cambiar el estado del pedido a Released."},{"id":"F","en":"Add Items, including Quantity, to the lines.","es":"Añadir artículos con su cantidad en las líneas."},{"id":"G","en":"Create a warehouse receipt.","es":"Crear una recepción de almacén."},{"id":"H","en":"Select Post and Receive.","es":"Seleccionar Post and Receive."}]},{"id":"s4q59","type":"build","en":"A company uses Business Central.<br><br>Accountants must upload customer data in Business Central in bulk by using Microsoft Excel.<br><br>You need to recommend how to maintain the list in Microsoft Excel, and display and edit it there.<br><br>Which four actions should you recommend be performed in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Los contables deben cargar en bloque datos de clientes en Business Central con Microsoft Excel, y mantener, ver y editar la lista en Excel.<br><br>¿Qué cuatro acciones recomiendas y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 4 · Q59","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Make changes to the customer records in Excel.","es":"Hacer los cambios en los clientes en Excel."},{"id":"B","en":"Download the Excel workbook to your device.","es":"Descargar el libro de Excel al dispositivo."},{"id":"C","en":"Sign in to the Business Central add-in in Excel.","es":"Iniciar sesión en el add-in de Business Central en Excel."},{"id":"D","en":"Export the customer records by using the Open in Excel action.","es":"Exportar los clientes con la acción Open in Excel."},{"id":"E","en":"Publish the changes back to Business Central.","es":"Publicar los cambios en Business Central."},{"id":"F","en":"Export the customer records by using the Edit in Excel action.","es":"Exportar los clientes con la acción Edit in Excel."}]},{"id":"cs1t4q44","type":"mc","en":"You need to configure a third location to allow transfer orders to be posted between the two warehouses.<br><br>What should you configure?","es":"Debes configurar una tercera location para poder registrar transfer orders entre los dos almacenes.<br><br>¿Qué debes configurar?","src":"Case Study 1 · Topic 4 · Q44","case":"CS1","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Default Dimensions","es":"Default Dimensions"},{"id":"B","en":"Use as In-Transit","es":"Use As In-Transit"},{"id":"C","en":"Cross-Dock Bin Code","es":"Cross-Dock Bin Code"},{"id":"D","en":"Bins","es":"Bins (ubicaciones)"}]},{"id":"cs1t4q45","type":"build","en":"You need to configure Business Central to quickly display all customers in the retail market.<br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"Debes configurar Business Central para mostrar rápidamente todos los clientes del mercado minorista (retail).<br><br>¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Case Study 1 · Topic 4 · Q45","case":"CS1","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Select Retail in the Customer posting group filter.","es":"Seleccionar Retail en el filtro Customer Posting Group."},{"id":"B","en":"Select Retail in the Gen. Bus. Posting Group filter.","es":"Seleccionar Retail en el filtro Gen. Bus. Posting Group."},{"id":"C","en":"Open the Customer List Page.","es":"Abrir la lista de clientes."},{"id":"D","en":"Save the view.","es":"Guardar la vista."},{"id":"E","en":"Open the Filter pane.","es":"Abrir el panel de filtros."}]},{"id":"cs1t4q46","type":"build","en":"You need to configure Business Central to pay vendors as required by the AP team.<br>Which five actions should you perform in sequence?","es":"Debes configurar Business Central para pagar a los proveedores como necesita el equipo de cuentas a pagar.<br><br>¿Qué cinco acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Case Study 1 · Topic 4 · Q46","case":"CS1","slots":5,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Open the General Journal Templates page.","es":"Abrir General Journal Templates."},{"id":"B","en":"Disable the ability to allow payment exports.","es":"Desactivar la exportación de pagos."},{"id":"C","en":"Create 2 new batch named Bank.","es":"Crear una sección nueva llamada Bank."},{"id":"D","en":"Open the General Journal Batches page.","es":"Abrir General Journal Batches."},{"id":"E","en":"Select the required General Journal template.","es":"Seleccionar la plantilla General."},{"id":"F","en":"Enable the ability to export a payment file.","es":"Activar la exportación del fichero de pagos."},{"id":"G","en":"Select the required Payment template.","es":"Seleccionar la plantilla Payment."},{"id":"H","en":"Create a new batch named EFT.","es":"Crear una sección nueva llamada EFT."}]}]};
